Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:17:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wip: R005 Tranche B Task 7 checkpoint (does not pass verify)

Checkpoint before the foundation assessment the user asked for on
2026-10-20; not for merging. Builds with 0 warnings. Not run: verify,
the differential, regression rows.

In it: several spreads accepted (SecondSpread retired);
Check/MergeLiteral (items pairwise disjoint for Spread, D2' immediate
and late, the literal's unknown tails desugared through
RowMerge/Chain desugaredWith, located at the innermost lambda);
removal and named rests by one requirement (Check/Remainder, P3 and
SeveralTails removed); lambda parameter names and same-name numbering
(Check/PartNames), part-origin notes, the ownerless numbered D4 form;
Check/Fault's case-bound blame limited to a part the lacking record is.
Every stage-7 fixture matched in a survey; the new literal and removal
tests partly red; tests that pin P3 still to update; the hint-companion
test fails. See docs/progress.md on r005b-replan.

